Many articles describe claimed beneﬁts created by the
agile RE approaches in comparison to the traditional RE
processes. These are listed below and summarized in Table
IV.
1) Lower process overheads (B1): Process overheads are
lower due to the lack of time-consuming documentation and
approval processes [S4], [S20], [S25] and reduced need to
rework requirements [S2].
